{"seq":2,"slug":"component-model-and-wit","title":"Component Model 与 WIT 接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/beyond-web/component-model-and-wit","wordCount":1185,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"component-model-与-wit-接口\">Component Model 与 WIT 接口</h1><p>Component Model 是 WebAssembly 从&quot;快速的沙箱字节码&quot;进化为&quot;可组合的通用执行层&quot;的关键拼图。它定义了 Wasm 组件如何声明自己的接口、如何与其他组件组合、如何跨语言传递复杂类型——不再需要手工序列化指针和字节偏移。2026 年 6 月，Bytecode Alliance 发布了 Component Model 1.0 路线图，标志着这一规范从&quot;实验&quot;走向&quot;工业标准&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Component Model 解决 Wasm 1.0 的三个系统性问题：胶水代码膨胀（每对语言需手写序列化）、内存不隔离（多模块共享线性内存）、无法组合（缺乏标准接口契约）。它通过 WIT（接口描述语言）定义类型化契约，通过 Canonical ABI 实现跨语言数据传递，通过组件组合工具（wac）链接独立编译的模块。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要-component-model\">为什么需要 Component Model</h2><p>Wasm 1.0 核心模块的接口极其简陋：导出的函数只能接收/返回 i32/i64/f32/f64。要传递一个字符串，需要：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>调用方在线性内存中分配空间</li>\n<li>将字符串字节写入该空间</li>\n<li>将指针（i32）和长度（i32）传给被调函数</li>\n<li>被调方从线性内存中读取字节</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这导致了三个系统性问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>胶水代码膨胀</td>\n<td>每个语言对需要手写序列化/反序列化逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存不隔离</td>\n<td>多个模块共享线性内存，一个 bug 可能覆写另一个模块的数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无法组合</td>\n<td>没有标准的&quot;接口契约&quot;，每个集成是定制的</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Component Model 用一层类型化的接口定义（WIT）解决了这三个问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wit-webassembly-interface-types\">WIT：WebAssembly Interface Types</h2><p>WIT 是 Component Model 的接口描述语言——类似 Protocol Buffers 或 GraphQL Schema，但专为 Wasm 组件设计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wit\" data-code=\"package mycompany:auth@0.1.0;&#10;&#10;interface authenticator {&#10;  record credentials {&#10;    username: string,&#10;    password: string,&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  record token {&#10;    value: string,&#10;    expires-at: u64,&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  enum auth-error {&#10;    invalid-credentials,&#10;    expired,&#10;    rate-limited,&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  authenticate: func(creds: credentials) -&gt; result&lt;token, auth-error&gt;;&#10;  validate: func(token-value: string) -&gt; result&lt;bool, auth-error&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;world auth-service {&#10;  import wasi:http/outgoing-handler@0.2.0;&#10;  import wasi:keyvalue/store@0.2.0;&#10;  export authenticator;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>package mycompany:auth@0.1.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface authenticator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  record credentials {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    username: string,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    password: string,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  record token {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    value: string,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expires-at: u64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  enum auth-error {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    invalid-credentials,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    expired,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rate-limited,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  authenticate: func(creds: credentials) -> result&#x3C;token, auth-error>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  validate: func(token-value: string) -> result&#x3C;bool, auth-error>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>world auth-service {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  import wasi:http/outgoing-handler@0.2.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  import wasi:keyvalue/store@0.2.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  export authenticator;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"wit-类型系统\">WIT 类型系统</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>WIT 类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>映射示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>bool</code></td>\n<td>布尔</td>\n<td>Rust: <code>bool</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>u8</code>..<code>u64</code>, <code>s8</code>..<code>s64</code></td>\n<td>整数</td>\n<td>Rust: <code>u8</code>..<code>u64</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>f32</code>, <code>f64</code></td>\n<td>浮点</td>\n<td>Rust: <code>f32</code>, <code>f64</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>UTF-8 字符串</td>\n<td>Rust: <code>String</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>list&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>变长列表</td>\n<td>Rust: <code>Vec&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>option&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>可选值</td>\n<td>Rust: <code>Option&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>result&lt;T, E&gt;</code></td>\n<td>结果或错误</td>\n<td>Rust: <code>Result&lt;T, E&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tuple&lt;T1, T2, ...&gt;</code></td>\n<td>元组</td>\n<td>Rust: <code>(T1, T2)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>record</code></td>\n<td>命名字段结构体</td>\n<td>Rust: <code>struct</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>enum</code></td>\n<td>无载荷枚举</td>\n<td>Rust: <code>enum</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>variant</code></td>\n<td>有载荷枚举</td>\n<td>Rust: <code>enum</code> with data</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flags</code></td>\n<td>位标志集合</td>\n<td>Rust: bitflags</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resource</code></td>\n<td>带生命周期的句柄</td>\n<td>Rust: 实现了 Drop 的类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"组件组合-跨语言-lego\">组件组合：跨语言 LEGO</h2><p>Component Model 的杀手级特性是<strong>组合</strong>——独立编译的组件可以在不共享内存的前提下互相调用：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Rust 组件&quot;&#10;        A[auth-filter&lt;br/&gt;exports: filter]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;JS 组件&quot;&#10;        B[personalize&lt;br/&gt;exports: transform]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Python 组件&quot;&#10;        C[analytics&lt;br/&gt;exports: track]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;组合后的应用&quot;&#10;        D[HTTP Request] --&gt; A&#10;        A --&gt; B&#10;        B --&gt; C&#10;        C --&gt; E[HTTP Response]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph \"Rust 组件\"\n        A[auth-filter&lt;br/&gt;exports: filter]\n    end\n    subgraph \"JS 组件\"\n        B[personalize&lt;br/&gt;exports: transform]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Python 组件\"\n        C[analytics&lt;br/&gt;exports: track]\n    end\n    subgraph \"组合后的应用\"\n        D[HTTP Request] --&gt; A\n        A --&gt; B\n        B --&gt; C\n        C --&gt; E[HTTP Response]\n    end</pre><p>每个组件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>拥有独立的线性内存（互相隔离）</li>\n<li>通过 WIT 接口声明自己的 import/export</li>\n<li>由组合工具（<code>wac</code>/<code>wasm-compose</code>）链接成一个复合组件</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"组合示例\">组合示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 WAC (WebAssembly Composition) 工具&#10;wac compose \\&#10;  --define auth=./auth.wasm \\&#10;  --define transform=./transform.wasm \\&#10;  --define analytics=./analytics.wasm \\&#10;  -o composed.wasm \\&#10;  app.wac\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 WAC (WebAssembly Composition) 工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wac</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --define</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> auth=./auth.wasm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --define</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> transform=./transform.wasm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --define</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> analytics=./analytics.wasm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> composed.wasm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  app.wac</span></span></code></pre></div><p>WAC 文件定义组合拓扑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// app.wac&#10;let auth = new auth {};&#10;let transform = new transform { logger: auth.logger };&#10;let analytics = new analytics { events: transform.events };&#10;export analytics.handler;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// app.wac</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let auth = new auth {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let transform = new transform { logger: auth.logger };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let analytics = new analytics { events: transform.events };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export analytics.handler;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"canonical-abi-类型如何跨越边界\">Canonical ABI：类型如何跨越边界</h2><p>组件间的数据传递通过 Canonical ABI（规范应用二进制接口）完成。当 Rust 组件向 Python 组件传递一个 <code>list&lt;string&gt;</code> 时：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Rust 侧将数据&quot;降低&quot;（lower）为 Canonical ABI 格式写入中间缓冲区</li>\n<li>Python 侧从缓冲区&quot;提升&quot;（lift）为 Python 的 <code>list[str]</code></li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Rust: Vec&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;&quot;] --&gt;|lower| B[Canonical ABI&lt;br/&gt;扁平内存表示]&#10;    B --&gt;|lift| C[Python: list[str]&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Rust: Vec&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;\"] --&gt;|lower| B[Canonical ABI&lt;br/&gt;扁平内存表示]\n    B --&gt;|lift| C[Python: list[str]\"]</pre><p>2026 年 Component Model 1.0 路线图中的 Lazy ABI 改进将这个过程进一步优化——通过惰性值句柄实现零拷贝转发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码生成与绑定\">代码生成与绑定</h2><p>各语言通过代码生成工具将 WIT 接口转为本地类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>绑定工具</th>\n<th>用法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td><code>wit-bindgen</code> / <code>cargo-component</code></td>\n<td><code>wit_bindgen::generate!()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td><code>jco</code> (ComponentizeJS)</td>\n<td><code>jco componentize app.js --wit wit/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td><code>componentize-py</code></td>\n<td><code>componentize-py -w my-world app.py -o app.wasm</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td><code>wit-bindgen-go</code></td>\n<td><code>wit-bindgen go --world my-world wit/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C/C++</td>\n<td><code>wit-bindgen-c</code></td>\n<td>生成头文件 + 实现桩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"rust-示例\">Rust 示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 自动生成 WIT 接口的 Rust trait&#10;wit_bindgen::generate!({&#10;    world: &quot;auth-service&quot;,&#10;    exports: {&#10;        &quot;mycompany:auth/authenticator&quot;: AuthImpl,&#10;    },&#10;});&#10;&#10;struct AuthImpl;&#10;&#10;impl exports::mycompany::auth::authenticator::Guest for AuthImpl {&#10;    fn authenticate(creds: Credentials) -&gt; Result&lt;Token, AuthError&gt; {&#10;        // 实现认证逻辑&#10;        Ok(Token {&#10;            value: &quot;jwt-token-here&quot;.to_string(),&#10;            expires_at: 1720000000,&#10;        })&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn validate(token_value: String) -&gt; Result&lt;bool, AuthError&gt; {&#10;        // 验证 token&#10;        Ok(token_value.starts_with(&quot;jwt-&quot;))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 自动生成 WIT 接口的 Rust trait</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wit_bindgen::generate!({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    world: \"auth-service\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    exports: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"mycompany:auth/authenticator\": AuthImpl,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct AuthImpl;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl exports::mycompany::auth::authenticator::Guest for AuthImpl {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn authenticate(creds: Credentials) -> Result&#x3C;Token, AuthError> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 实现认证逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(Token {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            value: \"jwt-token-here\".to_string(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            expires_at: 1720000000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn validate(token_value: String) -> Result&#x3C;bool, AuthError> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 验证 token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(token_value.starts_with(\"jwt-\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"javascript-示例\">JavaScript 示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 通过 jco 将 JS 代码编译为 Wasm 组件&#10;// auth.js&#10;export const authenticator = {&#10;  authenticate(creds) {&#10;    if (creds.username === &#39;admin&#39;) {&#10;      return { tag: &#39;ok&#39;, val: { value: &#39;token-123&#39;, expiresAt: 9999n } };&#10;    }&#10;    return { tag: &#39;err&#39;, val: &#39;invalid-credentials&#39; };&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通过 jco 将 JS 代码编译为 Wasm 组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// auth.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> authenticator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  authenticate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">creds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (creds.username </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { tag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ok'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, val: { value: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'token-123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, expiresAt: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9999</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { tag: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'err'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, val: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'invalid-credentials'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"component-model-1-0-路线图-2026\">Component Model 1.0 路线图（2026）</h2><p>Bytecode Alliance 在 2026 年 6 月公布了 1.0 的五大工作方向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ABI 改进</td>\n<td>Lazy ABI（惰性值句柄 + 零拷贝转发）</td>\n<td>性能提升、内存节省</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shared-everything Linking</td>\n<td>同语言组件共享内存（opt-in）</td>\n<td>消除语言内组件间的序列化开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原生 Async</td>\n<td><code>future&lt;T&gt;</code> 和 <code>stream&lt;T&gt;</code> 作为一等值类型</td>\n<td>WASI P3 的基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器原生支持</td>\n<td>Component Model 在浏览器内置实现</td>\n<td>无需 JS polyfill</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正式规范</td>\n<td>形式化定义 + 参考测试套件</td>\n<td>跨运行时一致性保证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"注册表与分发\">注册表与分发</h2><p>组件通过标准注册表分发——类似 npm 但面向 Wasm 组件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注册表</th>\n<th>维护方</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>wa.dev (warg)</td>\n<td>Bytecode Alliance</td>\n<td>标准推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>wasmer.io/wapm</td>\n<td>Wasmer</td>\n<td>老牌，但非标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OCI Registry</td>\n<td>CNCF/容器生态</td>\n<td>复用容器镜像仓库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 发布组件到 wa.dev&#10;wkg publish ./my-component.wasm&#10;&#10;# 从注册表拉取依赖&#10;wkg get mycompany:auth@0.1.0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 发布组件到 wa.dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wkg</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./my-component.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从注册表拉取依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wkg</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mycompany:auth@0.1.0</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Component Model 通过 WIT 接口和 Canonical ABI 解决了 Wasm 的跨语言组合问题</li>\n<li>组件间内存隔离、类型安全、零信任——每个组件是独立沙箱</li>\n<li>组合工具（wac/wasm-compose）将多个组件链接成复合应用</li>\n<li>各语言通过代码生成工具（wit-bindgen/jco/componentize-py）桥接 WIT 类型</li>\n<li>2026 年 Component Model 1.0 路线图包括 Lazy ABI、浏览器原生支持等关键改进</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"wasi-system-interface\">WASI 系统接口</a>：Component Model 之上的系统能力层</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../frontend-web-workers-parallelism/patterns/comlink-rpc\">Comlink RPC 模式</a>：类比 Component Model 的跨隔离边界通信模式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Component Model 与 WIT 接口","id":"component-model-与-wit-接口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要 Component Model","id":"为什么需要-component-model"},{"level":2,"text":"WIT：WebAssembly Interface Types","id":"wit-webassembly-interface-types"},{"level":3,"text":"WIT 类型系统","id":"wit-类型系统"},{"level":2,"text":"组件组合：跨语言 LEGO","id":"组件组合-跨语言-lego"},{"level":3,"text":"组合示例","id":"组合示例"},{"level":2,"text":"Canonical ABI：类型如何跨越边界","id":"canonical-abi-类型如何跨越边界"},{"level":2,"text":"代码生成与绑定","id":"代码生成与绑定"},{"level":3,"text":"Rust 示例","id":"rust-示例"},{"level":3,"text":"JavaScript 示例","id":"javascript-示例"},{"level":2,"text":"Component Model 1.0 路线图（2026）","id":"component-model-1-0-路线图-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"注册表与分发","id":"注册表与分发"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"WASI：WebAssembly 系统接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/beyond-web/wasi-system-interface"},"next":{"title":"边缘计算与 Serverless 中的 WebAssembly","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/beyond-web/edge-and-serverless"}}